:\nVolumes:\n  input:\n    Type:        Secret (a volume populated by a Secret)\n    SecretName:  unavailable-input\n    Optional:    false\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedMount  14m (x20 over 57m)    kubelet            Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition\n  Warning  FailedMount  4m56s (x35 over 59m)  kubelet            MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/af116f2402cf48d6-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/af116f2402cf48d6-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/af116f2402cf48d6-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

