data: {"id": "af116f2402cf48d6-thinking-parallel_evidence-1486", "run_id": "af116f2402cf48d6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经获取了 Pod 的详细描述。根据 `kubectl_describe` 结果，可以看到：\n\n1. **Pod 状态**: Pending (这与之前 PromQL 查到的 phase=Pending 一致)\n2. **Container 状态**: Waiting, Reason: ContainerCreating (确认了异常状态)\n3. **关键事件**: \n   - `FailedMount` - MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found\n   - `FailedMount` - Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]\n\n**初步判断**: Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段的直接原因是 **Volume 挂载失败**，具体是 Secret `unavailable-input` 不存在。这与上游候选原因（ImagePull/SandboxCre", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789121000261, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

